From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 18:34:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 106/107] drm/meson: add the T7 HDMI 2.1 transmitter bridge

Add a DRM bridge for the T7 HDMI transmitter (hdmitx21): DDC master for
EDID and SCDC, HPD, controller setup, PHY, AVI InfoFrame and 2 channel
I2S audio. Supported: TMDS up to 600 MHz (2160p60, scrambled above 340
MHz), RGB 8 bit, no HDCP.

Signed-off-by: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/meson/Kconfig          |   14 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/meson/Makefile         |    1 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/meson/meson_hdmitx21.c | 1014 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 1029 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/gpu/drm/meson/meson_hdmitx21.c

